# Weekly review: in Overdue push a task a day later and the next one to today, complete one from Upcoming, then find it in the Logbook and uncomplete it there.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
	- Prepare slides @due({today+1})
	- Ship release @done({today-1})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
END
keys gO
see 7 days ago
keys j }
keys } }
hide Renew passport
keys gU
see Tomorrow · 
keys x
see ✔ Prepare slides
keys gL
see Yesterday · 
see ✔ Ship release
keys x
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
	- Prepare slides @due({today+1})
	- Ship release @done({today-1})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
END
